<title>INDIA: Yield unchanged at Indian 364-day t-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Yield unchanged at Indian 364-day t-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained a cut-off price of 90.64 rupees at the 364-day treasury bill auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The yield was steady at 10.35 percent, dealers said.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it accepted nine bids for 2.70 billion rupees out of 15 bids for a total of 3.50 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average price was 90.64 rupees, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
